/E (As a team, we developed three user personas and analysed key tasks such as supporting employees who need assistance, addressing initiative delays caused by staffing changes, and removing employees from initiatives. Using a needs and cognitive acts table and a user journey map outlining actions, goals, emotions, thoughts, pain points, and opportunities, we identified critical user insights that informed the design and development of the final product.)
/Pg 19 0 R
